==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*makëda}}, derived from {{m|urj-fin-pro|*makjas}} (whence {{m|fi|maajas}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Adjective===
{{fi-adj|make|ampi|in}}

# [[sweet]] {{gloss|of taste, or figuratively}}
#: {{coi|fi|'''makea''' elämä|'''high''' life}}
#: {{ux|fi|Ei '''makeaa''' mahan täydeltä!|q=adage|Don't gorge on '''sweets'''!}}
# [[fresh]] {{gloss|of water: without salt; not saline}}

